 "notes": [
  "Posted 13 July 2001, before Coruscant; the list has no Coruscant-set card, so the format is Premiere - Tatooine.",
  "Starting cards as marked '(start)' in the list: Set Your Course For Alderaan, Death Star, Alderaan, Death Star: Docking Bay 327, Prepared Defenses, There Is No Try & Oppressive Enforcement, Imperial Arrest Order, Mobilization Points; these count toward the 60.",
  "Posted 'Death Star', 'Alderaan', 'Sullust', 'Kessel', 'Endor', 'Death StarDocking Bay 327' and 'EndorLanding Platform' dested the Dark pages (Endor: the Endor-set Dark system); the run-together site names are Death Star: Docking Bay 327, Endor: Landing Platform (Docking Bay), Executor: Docking Bay and Death Star: War Room.",
  "Posted 'Darth Maul x3' dested the Tatooine Darth Maul; 'U-3PO' U-3PO (Yoo-Threepio); 'Boba Fett in Slave 1' Boba Fett In Slave I; 'Twilek Advisor' Twi'lek Advisor. Secret Plans is the 2001 Effect, not a Defensive Shield.",
  "The 'COMBAT VEHICLE(1)' section header was mis-read as a card in the draft and is dropped; its one card is Blizzard 2.",
  "Total is 60 as published."
